      "content": "it doesnt even feel like they're just \"busy\" though. it feels more like i've been deleted. like i'm just a glitch in the system that they all collectively decided to ignore. i walk into a room and it's like there's a hole where i'm standing. if i'm already effectively invisible to everyone who matters... what's even the point of actually being here?",
